  "description": "<p data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"221\">Waarom kiezen voor de HP Omen X 27?</strong><br data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"224\">De <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"243\">HP Omen X 27</strong> is een high-performance gaming monitor, speciaal ontworpen voor eSports en competitief gamen. Met een <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"377\">27-inch Quad HD (2560x1440)</strong>-paneel, een <strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"423\">verversingssnelheid van 240Hz</strong> en <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"446\">1ms responstijd</strong> ervaar je vloeiende beelden zonder vertraging. Dankzij <strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"524\">AMD FreeSync 2 HDR</strong> speel je haarscherp en zonder tearing, ideaal voor snelle shooters en actievolle games.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"725\">Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"657\">nette staat</strong>, is volledig getest en wordt geleverd met <strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"722\">3 maanden garantie</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"760\">⭐ Belangrijkste pluspunten:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<li data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"826\">⚡ 240Hz refresh rate en 1ms responstijd voor ultieme snelheid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"890\">🖥️ 27-inch Quad HD (2560x1440) scherm voor scherpe details</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"955\">🎮 AMD FreeSync 2 HDR voor vloeiende gameplay zonder tearing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1003\">🌈 HDR-ondersteuning voor levendige kleuren</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1049\">🧼 In nette staat en professioneel getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1049\">Lamme poot!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1074\">📋 Specificaties:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1086\">Merk:</strong> HP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1113\"><strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1104\">Serie:</strong> Omen X</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1125\">Type:</strong> Gaming monitor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1173\"><strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1163\">Schermformaat:</strong> 27 inch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1214\"><strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1190\">Resolutie:</strong> Quad HD (2560 x 1440)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1249\"><strong data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1241\">Verversingssnelheid:</strong> 240Hz</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1280\"><strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1268\">Responstijd:</strong> 1ms (GTG)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1303\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1298\">Paneeltype:</strong> TN</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1329\">Kleurondersteuning:</strong> HDR, DCI-P3 90%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1405\"><strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1368\">Aansluitingen:</strong> HDMI 2.0, DisplayPort 1.4, USB hub</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1426\"><strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1418\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1459\"><strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1442\">Toestand:</strong> In nette staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1499\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1487\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 3 maanden</p>",
